{{Quote|''The hapless tanuki Kachi Kachi strides boldly forth as a living shield against the enemy of the cat army, able to withstand the hottest flames from the attacks of the Pyro Corps Cats taking cover behind him. Maybe if you evolve them, the next strategy will be just a little bit better thought out...''|[[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]' announcement}}
'''Kachi-Kachi''' (also known as '''Kachi Kachi''') is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.1 Update|Version 4.1]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]] increases movement speed and becomes strong against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

